Skype; if you aren't already member of this group, please contact me or=20
Gleki via Skype (my Skype name is "ilmen-vodhr"), and we'll add you to=20
the group.

If you're willing to chat vocally in Lojban but this time interval is=20
not suitable for you, please feel free to propose another session (you=20
can also check whether there's somebody attending the Metal Bunker=20
server on Mumble).

